WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:01.600
Welcome to Unica!

2
00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:03.713
We're so excited to work with your child.

3
00:00:04.048 --> 00:00:05.768
This video walks you through everything:

4
00:00:06.078 --> 00:00:06.848
how to set up,

5
00:00:07.138 --> 00:00:09.452
what each day looks like, and what happens next.

6
00:00:09.918 --> 00:00:13.026
Your child's workbook is made from their free math check,

7
00:00:13.086 --> 00:00:14.226
at their exact level,

8
00:00:14.246 --> 00:00:15.714
following the BC curriculum.

9
00:00:16.236 --> 00:00:18.300
On page 2, you'll find the schedule.

10
00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:20.120
The workbook has 10 days,

11
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.433
and your child does one day at a time,

12
00:00:22.762 --> 00:00:24.612
in order, Day 1 to Day 10.

13
00:00:24.794 --> 00:00:26.083
They do five days a week,

14
00:00:26.543 --> 00:00:27.287
with two days off.

15
00:00:27.556 --> 00:00:29.540
Most families do Monday to Friday,

16
00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:31.101
but you can pick any five days.

17
00:00:31.311 --> 00:00:32.816
Just keep the same days each week.

18
00:00:33.306 --> 00:00:34.674
First, a quick setup.

19
00:00:34.824 --> 00:00:36.134
You only do this once.

20
00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:37.609
One: sign in.

21
00:00:37.969 --> 00:00:39.699
Scan the QR code on your guide,

22
00:00:40.119 --> 00:00:43.644
or go to unicalearning.com/account on your phone.

23
00:00:43.982 --> 00:00:45.612
Two: set up Maya,

24
00:00:45.772 --> 00:00:47.251
our AI Teaching Assistant.

25
00:00:47.583 --> 00:00:49.871
Set a PIN for your child's desk,

26
00:00:49.871 --> 00:00:51.401
and agree to the Maya notice.

27
00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:53.243
Three: find the schedule.

28
00:00:53.593 --> 00:00:55.393
It's on page 2 of the workbook,

29
00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:57.990
and in your account, under Workbooks.

30
00:00:58.686 --> 00:01:00.270
Here's what each day looks like.

31
00:01:00.572 --> 00:01:02.365
Your child does today's pages.

32
00:01:02.655 --> 00:01:03.839
Let them try it alone first.

33
00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:05.179
If they get stuck,

34
00:01:05.349 --> 00:01:08.009
they can call Maya from their desk on our website,

35
00:01:08.199 --> 00:01:10.929
and Maya opens the exact question on a whiteboard

36
00:01:10.979 --> 00:01:13.167
and talks them through it, step by step.

37
00:01:13.658 --> 00:01:15.333
Once the day's pages are done,

38
00:01:15.543 --> 00:01:16.253
you scan them.

39
00:01:16.733 --> 00:01:17.304
Here's how.

40
00:01:17.624 --> 00:01:21.955
On your phone, go to unicalearning.com/account/scan,

41
00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.230
and tap “Scan pages”.

42
00:01:24.663 --> 00:01:28.299
On a laptop, you'll see a code to scan with your phone instead.

43
00:01:28.698 --> 00:01:30.878
Take a photo of each finished page.

44
00:01:31.398 --> 00:01:32.768
Lay it flat, in good light,

45
00:01:33.107 --> 00:01:34.377
with the whole page in the frame.

46
00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:37.340
The QR code on each page tells us which page it is.

47
00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:39.880
Snap all your pages, then tap “Done”.

48
00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:43.290
If a page needs another photo, it shows at the top.

49
00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:44.900
Tap “Retake”.

50
00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:48.050
The rest go for marking by themselves,

51
00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:50.240
with a few seconds to “Undo”.

52
00:01:50.865 --> 00:01:53.410
Then open a page, and tap “View page results”.

53
00:01:53.778 --> 00:01:55.188
Each page comes back marked,

54
00:01:55.498 --> 00:01:57.237
with the steps for anything they missed.

55
00:01:57.650 --> 00:01:59.050
Go over the marks together.

56
00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:00.540
On anything they missed,

57
00:02:00.730 --> 00:02:02.585
tap “Explain this problem”

58
00:02:02.936 --> 00:02:05.023
for a simple explanation you can use with your child.

59
00:02:05.581 --> 00:02:06.371
That's one day.

60
00:02:06.911 --> 00:02:08.501
Do the same for all ten days:

61
00:02:08.771 --> 00:02:10.682
pages, scan, marks.

62
00:02:11.052 --> 00:02:11.662
Missed a day?

63
00:02:12.142 --> 00:02:12.682
No problem.

64
00:02:12.682 --> 00:02:14.109
Just pick up where they left off.

65
00:02:14.485 --> 00:02:15.575
Scan once a day,

66
00:02:15.895 --> 00:02:17.280
after the day's pages are done.

67
00:02:17.605 --> 00:02:19.665
Every scan shows us what your child understands,

68
00:02:19.665 --> 00:02:20.909
and what they don't yet.

69
00:02:21.429 --> 00:02:23.489
Two weeks after your workbook arrives,

70
00:02:23.679 --> 00:02:25.270
your next one arrives in the mail.

71
00:02:25.652 --> 00:02:28.142
It's built from everything your child did in this one:

72
00:02:28.612 --> 00:02:30.372
more practice where they slipped,

73
00:02:30.602 --> 00:02:31.672
less where they're strong,

74
00:02:31.672 --> 00:02:33.300
and new topics when they're ready.

75
00:02:33.662 --> 00:02:35.022
And then the loop starts again.

76
00:02:35.552 --> 00:02:36.078
Questions?

77
00:02:36.418 --> 00:02:38.862
Email us at contact@unicalearning.com.

78
00:02:39.230 --> 00:02:40.221
We read every message.

79
00:02:40.748 --> 00:02:42.308
Once again, welcome to Unica.

80
00:02:42.408 --> 00:02:45.098
We're so excited to see your child grow with us.
